{"id":"b158894eb95b8388","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-forcing3-iteration-projection.md","title":"ZFC Forcing3 Iteration Projection","display":"df-zfc-forcing3-iteration-projection — ZFC Forcing3 Iteration Projection","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing3-iteration-projection","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing3-iteration-projection"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing3-iteration-projection — ZFC Forcing3 Iteration Projection","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration.md]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-function-restriction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing3-iteration-projection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing3-iteration-projection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing3-iteration-projection — ZFC Forcing3 Iteration Projection"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d0dbf9d922eaa5eb\" href=\"?note=d0dbf9d922eaa5eb\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cfb4df0f853ccdd7\" href=\"?note=cfb4df0f853ccdd7\" title=\"58-df-function-restriction\">58-df-function-restriction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\vec{\\mathbb Q},\\delta,\\mathsf{Step},\\mathsf{Limit},\\alpha,\\beta,\\pi\\in V\">\\(\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\vec{\\mathbb Q},\\delta,\\mathsf{Step},\\mathsf{Limit},\\alpha,\\beta,\\pi\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingIteration}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingIteration}_S\\)</span> (five-place forcing-iteration predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d0dbf9d922eaa5eb\" href=\"?note=d0dbf9d922eaa5eb\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3IterationProjection}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3IterationProjection}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}projection}\n\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3IterationProjection}_S\n(\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\alpha,\\beta,\\pi)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\exists\\vec{\\mathbb Q},\\delta,\\mathsf{Step},\\mathsf{Limit}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingIteration}_S\n(\\delta,\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\vec{\\mathbb Q},\\mathsf{Step},\\mathsf{Limit})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\delta\\cup\\{\\delta\\}\n\\land\\alpha\\leq\\beta\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}\n(\\pi,\\vec{\\mathbb P}(\\beta),\\vec{\\mathbb P}(\\alpha))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall p\\in\\vec{\\mathbb P}(\\beta)\\;\n(\\pi(p)=p\\upharpoonright\\alpha)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}projection}\n\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3IterationProjection}_S\n(\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\alpha,\\beta,\\pi)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\exists\\vec{\\mathbb Q},\\delta,\\mathsf{Step},\\mathsf{Limit}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingIteration}_S\n(\\delta,\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\vec{\\mathbb Q},\\mathsf{Step},\\mathsf{Limit})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\delta\\cup\\{\\delta\\}\n\\land\\alpha\\leq\\beta\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}\n(\\pi,\\vec{\\mathbb P}(\\beta),\\vec{\\mathbb P}(\\alpha))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall p\\in\\vec{\\mathbb P}(\\beta)\\;\n(\\pi(p)=p\\upharpoonright\\alpha)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The projection is now a typed function graph and is pointwise the restriction map from stage <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> to stage <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The iteration witness includes the iterand sequence, length, successor-step relation, and limit-support relation required by the exact five-place upstream signature; it does not call the incompatible one-place placeholder formerly used here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration.md","status":"resolved","id":"d0dbf9d922eaa5eb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function-restriction","status":"resolved","id":"cfb4df0f853ccdd7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · d